    "verse_text_transliterated": "wa-idh q\u0101la m\u016bs\u0101 liqawmihi y\u0101qawmi lima tu'dh\u016bnan\u012b waqad ta\u02bflam\u016bna ann\u012b ras\u016blu l-lahi ilaykum falamm\u0101 z\u0101gh\u016b az\u0101gha l-lahu qul\u016bbahum wal-lahu l\u0101 yahd\u012b l-qawma l-f\u0101siq\u012bn",
